description:
Can a celebrity fashion designer create a runway-ready look on a budget? @GunnarDeatherage is known for his custom fashion and creative direction for stars like @ChappellRoan and @Shakira.  But today, he’s taking us behind the scenes of his design process as he faces his toughest design challenge yet.

In honor of the fashion design community, Gunnar uses his sewing and pattern-making skills to attempt a $100 gala challenge. From outfit ideas and mood boards to fabric selection and styling tips, he's getting you runway ready. Either way, it’s high fashion couture, honey!

